---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import brandi from '../assets/brandi.png';

const pillars = [
	{ name: 'Strength', description: 'Supporting athletic performance while maintaining healthy movement.' },
	{ name: 'Mobility', description: 'Developing usable range of motion that improves lifting mechanics and everyday function.' },
	{ name: 'Recovery', description: 'Helping the body repair, adapt, and perform at its highest level.' },
	{ name: 'Resilience', description: 'Building mental focus, consistency, confidence, and self-awareness.' },
	{ name: 'Community', description: 'Creating an encouraging environment where everyone feels welcome.' },
];
---

<Layout>
	<PageHeader title="About" subtitle="Strength In Motion · Recovery With Purpose" />

	<main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
		<!-- INTRO -->
		<section class="text-center">
			<p class="text-brand-cyan uppercase tracking-widest text-sm">Meet Your Instructor</p>
			<h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight uppercase">
				Brandi Kelty
			</h2>
			<p class="mt-4 text-brand-silver uppercase tracking-widest text-sm">
				200-Hour Certified Yoga Instructor
			</p>
			<div class="mt-12 flex justify-center">
				<Image
					src={brandi}
					alt="Brandi Kelty, Iron Flow Wellness instructor"
					width={480}
					height={480}
					class="rounded-lg border border-white/10"
				/>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- STORY -->
		<section class="mt-20 space-y-6 text-brand-silver text-lg leading-relaxed">
			<p>
				There was a time in my life when I believed strength meant handling everything on my own. I measured success by what I could accomplish, how hard I could push, and whether I appeared to have everything together.
			</p>
			<p>Recovery taught me something completely different.</p>
			<p>
				It taught me that strength begins with honesty. It grows through humility. It is sustained by grace. Healing didn't happen because I became stronger on my own. It happened because I surrendered, accepted help, and learned to trust God one day at a time.
			</p>
			<p>That journey changed every part of my life, including the way I approach fitness.</p>
		</section>

		<!-- LIFTING TO YOGA -->
		<section class="mt-16 space-y-6 text-brand-silver text-lg leading-relaxed">
			<h3 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight uppercase text-white">
				Lifting Challenged My Body. Yoga Challenged My Heart.
			</h3>
			<p>
				As someone who genuinely loves lifting weights, I understand why many people are skeptical of yoga. I used to think it was mostly about flexibility. My own experience completely changed that perspective.
			</p>
			<p>
				The more I incorporated yoga into my lifting routine, the more I noticed improvements in my mobility, balance, breathing, recovery, body awareness, and even my performance under the bar. Yoga didn't make me weaker. It made me move better.
			</p>
			<p>That realization inspired Iron Flow.</p>
		</section>

		<!-- WHAT IRON FLOW IS -->
		<section class="mt-16 space-y-6 text-brand-silver text-lg leading-relaxed">
			<h3 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight uppercase text-white">
				What Iron Flow Really Is
			</h3>
			<p>
				Iron Flow is a yoga program designed for strength athletes, bodybuilders, powerlifters, everyday gym members, and beginners alike. This isn't about turning lifters into yogis. It's about helping strong people stay strong.
			</p>
			<p>
				Every class blends mobility, stability, breathwork, flexibility, balance, recovery, and mindfulness into movement that directly supports performance in the gym and longevity outside of it.
			</p>
		</section>

		<!-- FIVE PILLARS -->
		<section class="mt-20">
			<div class="text-center">
				<p class="text-brand-cyan uppercase tracking-widest text-sm">The Foundation</p>
				<h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight uppercase">
					Five Pillars
				</h3>
			</div>
			<div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5">
				{pillars.map(pillar => (
					<div class="border border-white/10 p-6 hover:border-brand-cyan transition-colors">
						<h4 class="font-display text-lg font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-cyan">{pillar.name}</h4>
						<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-brand-silver leading-relaxed">{pillar.description}</p>
					</div>
				))}
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- FAITH / HEART -->
		<section class="mt-20 border-t border-white/10 pt-20">
			<div class="text-center">
				<p class="text-brand-cyan uppercase tracking-widest text-sm">The Heart Of Iron Flow</p>
				<h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight uppercase">
					More Than A Class
				</h3>
			</div>
			<div class="mt-12 space-y-6 text-brand-silver text-lg leading-relaxed">
				<p>
					Iron Flow is more than a yoga class. It is the intersection of my faith, my recovery, and my belief that true strength is built from the inside out.
				</p>
				<p>
					I no longer see movement as something I do to punish my body or earn my worth. I see it as a way of honoring the incredible gift God has given me. My faith reminds me that my body is not simply something I possess. It is something I have been entrusted to care for.
				</p>
				<p>
					Iron Flow will always be a place where people are welcomed exactly as they are. Whether someone walks in carrying physical pain, emotional burdens, stress, self-doubt, or simply sore muscles after leg day, my hope is that they leave feeling stronger, lighter, and more hopeful than when they arrived.
				</p>
				<p>
					I don't expect everyone who comes to class to share my faith. But I do hope everyone experiences the love, kindness, patience, and encouragement that my faith has taught me to offer.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="mt-12 text-center">
				<p class="font-display italic text-brand-cyan text-xl">
					"Above all, love each other deeply."
				</p>
				<p class="mt-2 text-brand-silver text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">
					1 Peter 4:8
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- CLOSING TAGLINE -->
		<section class="mt-20 border-t border-white/10 pt-20 text-center">
			<h3 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight uppercase leading-tight">
				Train Hard.<br />
				Recover Intentionally.<br />
				Live Fully.
			</h3>
			<p class="mt-8 text-brand-silver text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
				This is the heart of Iron Flow. Not through perfection, but through presence. Not through performance, but through purpose.
			</p>
		</section>

		<!-- CTA -->
		<section class="mt-20 text-center">
			<p class="text-brand-silver text-lg mb-8">
				Come as you are. Leave a little stronger.
			</p>
			<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
				<a href="/classes" class="inline-block bg-brand-cyan text-brand-black font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm px-8 py-4 hover:bg-white transition-colors">
					View Classes
				</a>
				<a href="/contact" class="inline-block border border-white/20 text-white font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm px-8 py-4 hover:border-brand-cyan hover:text-brand-cyan transition-colors">
					Get In Touch
				</a>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>